# Source package for GTA IV - not served by the site. Its original 7.8 GB ISO
# and 66 MB wasm exceed Cloudflare's per-asset size limit; the playable copy
# lives in games/gta4/ with both files split into .partNNN chunks.
gta4-web-v0.1.8/

# Raw per-file vcsky source dumps. The WASM still streams individual
# audio/model files from these URLs, so they are packed into the range-
# addressable split parts in games/gta/vc/vcsky/packs/ (see pack-vcsky.js
# and handleVcsky in sw.js). Excluding the originals keeps the deploy far
# below Cloudflare's 20,000-asset limit.
games/gta/vc/vcsky/fetched/
games/gta/vc/vcsky/fetched-ru/